gcc: error: liblnetconfig_wrap.o: No such file or directory
make: *** [dlc] Error 1
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Steps taken:&lt;br/&gt;
